{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55809","headline":"示坐禅方便颂 · 省澄","name":"示坐禅方便颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四威仪内坐爲先，澄虑身心渐坦然。\n瞥尔有缘随浊界，当须莫续是天年。\n修持只话（《五灯会元》作「秪学」）从功路，至理宁论在那边。\n一切时中常管带，因缘相凑豁通玄。\n（以上二首均见《景德传灯录》卷二九、《五灯会元》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"省澄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}